%% DocPilot - Chat / RAG sequence: POST /organizations/{org}/chat
%% Single request/response (no streaming on the backend).
%% Changes vs. previous version: three-list retrieval, adaptive thinking in the LLM client.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as User
    participant FE as React SPA
    participant API as Chat route
    participant AZ as Auth dependencies
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant EM as BGE-M3 (in process)
    participant LLM as llama.cpp server

    U->>FE: type question
    FE->>API: POST /api/organizations/ORG/chat {query, top_k=5, conversation_id?}
    API->>AZ: get_current_user, get_organization_access
    AZ->>DB: load active user, load membership
    AZ-->>API: OrganizationAccess (401 or 403 on failure)

    opt conversation_id supplied
        API->>DB: SELECT conversation WHERE id, organization_id, created_by_user_id
        DB-->>API: row or none (none gives 404)
        API->>DB: last 10 messages, bounded to 1,200 chars
    end

    Note over API: Rule-based routing (regex heuristics)
    alt name introduction or name recall
        API->>API: canned answer, no retrieval, no LLM
    else source-reference question ("which document...")
        API->>DB: sources of previous assistant message
        API->>API: answer from saved source names, no LLM
    else small talk
        API->>LLM: greeting prompt (no documents)
    else general-knowledge question
        API->>LLM: general-knowledge prompt (no documents)
    else document question
        opt follow-up pattern needs history ("and ...", "what about ...")
            API->>LLM: rewrite as standalone question (history sent here only)
            LLM-->>API: standalone question (503 if LLM fails)
        end
        API->>EM: embed_query (threadpool)
        EM-->>API: 1024-d vector
        API->>DB: vector query + strict keyword query + OR-keyword query (organization scoped)
        DB-->>API: candidates
        API->>API: RRF fusion (weights 1.0 / 1.0 / 0.10), heuristic boosts, top_k
        alt no chunks retrieved
            API->>API: fixed "couldn't find relevant information" answer, no LLM
        else chunks found
            API->>API: build context (max 12,000 chars) + system prompt
            API->>LLM: question + excerpts (no chat history)
            Note over API,LLM: client picks fast mode (temp 0) or thinking mode<br/>(numbers, dates, eligibility wording).<br/>If thinking fails, times out or is cut off,<br/>it retries once in fast mode
            LLM-->>API: answer (503 if both attempts fail)
            API->>API: year-specific admissions deadline guard
        end
    end

    API->>DB: create conversation if new (title = first 200 chars of query)
    API->>DB: INSERT user message + assistant message (with sources JSON), COMMIT
    API-->>FE: ChatResponse {conversation_id, answer, sources, trace[]}
    FE-->>U: render answer, sources panel, trace panel
    FE->>API: GET /conversations (refresh sidebar)
